# Update list below, when patch is released DO NOT REMOVE IT, instead add next one below the most recent patch
1.4 Open Beta - Patch 4 changelog
*Additions
- Systems
  - Compatibility with Hearth of Iron version 1.19.4
  - Reworked "State Focus" interface, including new, bigger icons. Additionally interface is now visible only after clicking on owned or controlled states
  - Redesigned Orbit Wars
    - Completely reworked, more optimized code behind whole system
    - Reworked success/failure system
    - Different parts now require other technologies as well as other rocket parts, and their cost is determined by available civilian factories
    - Changed Research Domes research points gain. First one grants 15 points monthly, but any subsequent grants only 5
    - Different sattelite types have multiple uses before being destroyed
    - Improved sattelite abilities
    - Rocket parts no longer reset after every launch
    - Added button to toggle auto-launch, game will try to fire it on weekly basis if requirements are met
  - Added currently active SocDev campaigns and their cap indicator on top the SocDev window
  - Updated Kaiserreich unit limiter to match their changes
- Technologies
  - Tech trees
    - Minor change of layout and years of non NSB and NSB Landship and Automat techs
    - SP Artillery, Destroyers and SPAA variants of Landships and Automats are now integrated into main techs inside the non NSB version, subtechs are removed
    - Removed obsolete non BBA air technologies changing tree layout to resemble vanilla more. Heavy Fighters branch out of the Fighters now.
    - New descriptions for multiple technologies, making them more lore accurate
    - Expanded electronics tech tree
    - Computing technologies now grant special project research speed bonuses
  - Modules
    - New electronics based modules (radars, radio etc.) for all 3 types of designers
    - New types of light turret types for roleplayers
    - Heat Rays for automats are now unlocked by new Teleforce special project
  - Special projects
    - 5 new special projects
    - Radar special project changed to Decimetric Radar
    - Rocket Interceptor project changed to Rocket Engine
- GFX
  - New mod logo
  - Scout Helicopters generic icons
- Others
  - ITTL change of Australia name to Meridiana
  - Added 15 new native cultures in North America
  - Orbit Wars UI changes and improvements
    - Completely new, more responsive and intuitive UI buttons based system
    - "Orbital Superiority" display
    - Improved Tooltips
    - UI will now use ENG/RUS flags dynamically instead of predetermined GFX
    - Toggleable spinning Pax globe
    - Ability to track successful/failed launches as well as sattelites for numbers nerds
*Fixes
- Fixed empty EQ production list caused by the 1.19.3
- Orbit Wars victor will receive national spirit and superevent properly
- Nukes counter is no longer covered by other elements of topbar
- Mech. Rocket Arty brigade now use their dedicated equipment